    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAT-A-STROPHIC</strong> is a goofy arcade 3D city destruction game with  rogue-like elements where you play as Bluu, a colossal kaiju cat, rampaging through different cities to rescue your precious kittens! Embrace the purr-fect blend of chaos and relaxation as you level multiple towns and cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601970/extras/801a99adfcaa96889cdbe0aff8ba6df5.avif?t=1753714771\" width=498 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash havoc by swiping at buildings, pouncing on structures, and hurling objects with telekinesis.\u00a0 As the chaos unfolds, enemies will continuously spawn to capture Bluu and stop her destruction spree.\u00a0 Once the level is cleared, you can rescue a kitten that supercharges Bluu\u2019s powers, enhancing her abilities with unique effects like summoning lightning storms or turning invisible. Embrace the carnage, adapt your playstyle, and lead Bluu to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601970/extras/1db913a264610c9bc857a82d78cd409a.avif?t=1753714771\" width=498 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAT-A-STROPHIC</strong> is a goofy arcade 3D city destruction game with  rogue-like elements where you play as Bluu, a colossal kaiju cat, rampaging through different cities to rescue your precious kittens! Embrace the purr-fect blend of chaos and relaxation as you level multiple towns and cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601970/extras/801a99adfcaa96889cdbe0aff8ba6df5.avif?t=1753714771\" width=498 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash havoc by swiping at buildings, pouncing on structures, and hurling objects with telekinesis.\u00a0 As the chaos unfolds, enemies will continuously spawn to capture Bluu and stop her destruction spree.\u00a0 Once the level is cleared, you can rescue a kitten that supercharges Bluu\u2019s powers, enhancing her abilities with unique effects like summoning lightning storms or turning invisible. Embrace the carnage, adapt your playstyle, and lead Bluu to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601970/extras/1db913a264610c9bc857a82d78cd409a.avif?t=1753714771\" width=498 height=100 /></span></p>",
